  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\nIn this question, two signs should be interchanged to make the given equation correct.\n\n**Given: **(50 ÷ 3) × 15 + 25 − 10 = 25\n\n**Option 1) **÷ and -\n\nAfter interchanging the two signs we get the;\n\n⇒ __**(50 - 3)**__ × 15 + 25 ÷ 10 = 25\n\n⇒ 47 × 15 + __**25 ÷ 10**__ = 25\n\n⇒ __**47 **__×__** 15**__ + 2.5 = 25\n\n⇒ 705 + 2.5 = 25\n\n⇒ 707.5 ≠ 25\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option 2) **+ and × \n\nAfter interchanging the two signs we get the;\n\n⇒ __**(50 ÷ 3)**__ + 15 × 25 − 10 = 25\n\n⇒ 16.66 + __**15 **__×__** 25 **__- 10 = 25\n\n⇒ __**16.66 + 375**__ - 10 = 25\n\n⇒ __**391.66 - 10**__ = 25\n\n⇒ 381.66 ≠ 25\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option 3) **÷ and × \n\nAfter interchanging the two signs we get the;\n\n⇒ __**(50 **__×__** 3)**__ ÷ 15 + 25 − 10 = 25\n\n⇒ __**150 ÷ 15**__ + 25 - 10 = 25\n\n⇒ __**10 + 25**__ - 10 = 25\n\n⇒ __**35 - 10**__ = 25\n\n⇒ 25 = 25\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\n**Option 4) **+ and − \n\nAfter interchanging the two signs we get the;\n\n⇒ __**(50 ÷ 3)**__ × 15 - 25 + 10 = 25\n\n⇒ __**16.66 * 15**__ - 25 + 10 = 25\n\n​⇒__** 249.9**__ - 25 __**+ 10**__ = 25\n\n​⇒ 259.9 - 25 = 25\n\n​⇒ 234.9 ≠ 25\n\n​⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\".**\n\n62:T1d",
